{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":504218,"name":"Mike Winn","username":"Mike_Winn","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/51bf81/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T19:07:08.937Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNew grok bot account configured - none of the agents can connect to their cloud computers.  Mobile app doesn’t work saying waiting for reconnect.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok bot agent computer stuck.  Please recover server-side.\u003cbr\u003e\naccount \u003ca href=\"mailto:michaeljwinn1@gmail.com\"\u003emichaeljwinn1@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBots: max + 2 others on this account.  All fail.  Devices mac desktop OS + iphone save after delete/re-install.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat we see. app white-screens for 40 + seconds.  Agents load slowley then starting desktop - cant reach agent computer reetry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSettings update udpate grok bots comuputer tried: still failes.  Check for updates. Does nothing.  iPhone - send after reconnect. retry fails.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried force quick re-open.  iphone re-install.  Update computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease help!! \u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/fluentui/slight_smile.png?v=15\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e  Thank you!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen grok bot.  Slow to load, no agents are able to connect to their computers.  Mobile fails waiting to connect.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgents can connect to their own computer and mobile app interacts with you not says waiting to connect.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eversion 0.63.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgents failing.  please help!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504218-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504218-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:07:17.315Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":12,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":60.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173434,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agents-cannot-connect-to-cloud-computers-mobile-stuck-reconnecting","display_username":"Mike Winn","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140416,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agents-cannot-connect-to-cloud-computers-mobile-stuck-reconnecting/173434/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":504230,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.081Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mike_winn\"\u003e@Mike_Winn\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report. This wasn’t caused by anything on your end. Your Grok Bot computer didn’t finish its first startup, so we rebuilt it on our side, and it’s running now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFully quit Grok Bot on your Mac (from the menu bar icon) and on your iPhone, then reopen both. Your bots and chat history are all still there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf anything still won’t connect, reply here, and we’ll take another look. Have fun!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.081Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":5.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173434,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agents-cannot-connect-to-cloud-computers-mobile-stuck-reconnecting","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":